{"id":"P092-1","subject":"P","unit":"P092","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","set":1,"questions":[{"id":"P092-S1-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 1번","searchText":" 01\n\n퍼센트 임피던스가 , 전압이 kV, 용량이 kVA \n\n일 때, 임피던스를 구하는 식으로 옳은 것은?\n\n\n\n①                ② ×      \n\n                                 ③               ④ ×      ×\n\n          ⑤ ×","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m01","number":1},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m01-q.webp","width":678,"height":712},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m01-e1.webp","width":678,"height":777}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 2번","searchText":" 02\n\n우리나라에서 송전전압으로 가장 많이 쓰이는 것은??\n\n\n① 66kV        ② 154kV\n\n③ 220kV       ④ 300kV\n\n⑤ 345kV","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m02","number":2},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m02-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m02-e1.webp","width":678,"height":571}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n고압 가공전선을 건조물의 상부 조영재 옆쪽으로 접근하여\n\n시설할 때, 고압 가공전선과 건조물의 조영재 사이의 이격\n\n거리m는? (단, 사람이 출입할 수 없도록 한 경우이다.)\n\n\n① 0.4          ② 0.8\n\n③ 1.0          ④ 1.2\n\n⑤ 2.0","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":521},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1428}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n다음 중 통신선 및 전력선의 유도장해 경감대책으로 옳지 않\n\n은 것은?\n\n\n① 전력선과 통신선을 가능한 멀리 시설한다.\n\n② 통신선에 차폐케이블을 설치한다.\n\n③ 연피케이블을 사용한다.\n\n④ 전력선과 통신선을 수평으로 시설한다.\n\n⑤ 연가를 시행한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":407},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m04-e2.webp","width":678,"height":820}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n송전선로의 회로정수가 , × ,\n\n일 때, 의 값은?\n\n(단, 소수점 둘째자리에서 반올림한다.)\n\n\n①        ② \n\n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":647},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":643}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n전선로에서 부하율와 손실계수의 관계는?\n\n\n① ≦≦≦≦\n② ≦≦≦≦\n③ ≦≦≦≦\n④ ≦≦≦≦\n⑤ ≦≦≦≦","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":506},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m06-e1.webp","width":678,"height":422}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n비돌극형 3상 동기 발전기의 동기 리액턴스가 10Ω,\n전기자 저항이 0.1Ω, 유기기전력이 5300V,\n\n단자전압 이3600V, 상차각이 60°일 때, 동기발\n전기의 한 상 출력kW은?\n\n\n① 1548         ② 1652\n\n③ 1662         ④ 1675\n\n⑤ 1680","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":732},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m07-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1415}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n3300/210V, 5000kVA인 단상 변압기에서 1차측\n으로 등가환산한 %저항강하가 4.8, %리액턴스\n\n강하가 3.6일 때, 임피던스 전압V은?\n\n\n① 180         ② 193\n\n③ 198         ④ 209\n\n⑤ 226","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m08-e1.webp","width":696,"height":467},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m08-e2.webp","width":678,"height":985}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n3상 직권 정류자 전동기에 중간변압기를 사용하는 이유로\n\n옳지 않은것은?\n\n\n① 경부하시 회전속도의 이상 상승 억제를 위해\n\n② 권수비를 조정하기 위해\n\n③ 회전사의 상수를 감소시키기 위해\n\n④ 회전자 전압을 정류작용에 맞는 값으로 선정하기 위해\n\n⑤ 전원전압에 관계없이 회전자전압을 일정하게 유지하기\n\n  위해","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m09-q.webp","width":678,"height":548},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m09-e1.webp","width":678,"height":899}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n특고압 배전선로에 접속하는 배전용 변압기의 1차측 전압\n\n은 몇 kV이하로 해야 하는가?\n\n\n① 10          ② 20\n\n③ 25          ④ 30\n\n⑤ 35","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":786}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n다음 중 도로 조명설계에 관한 내용으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 곡선도로에서 양쪽 배열시에는 지그재그로 배열하고,\n\n  한쪽 배열시에는 바깥쪽에만 배열한다.\n\n② 직선도로에서 조명은 대칭배열, 지그재그배열, 한쪽배열,\n\n  중앙배열로 배치할 수 있다.\n\n③ 곡선도로에서 조명을 설계할 때, 곡률반경이 작을수록\n\n  조도를 더 크게 해야한다.\n\n④ 곡선도로의 곡률반경이 클수록 등기구의 간격을 늘려도\n\n  된다.\n\n⑤ 안개가 끼는 곳이나 어두운 터널과 같은 장소에는 고압\n\n  나트륨등을 사용하는 것이 좋다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m11","number":11},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m11-q.webp","width":696,"height":803},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m11-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1096}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q12","number":12,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 12번","searchText":" 12\n\n3상3선식 배전선을 통해 16kW, 역률 0.85인 부하에\n\n전력을 공급할 때, 송전단 전압V은?\n\n(단, 수전단 전압은 1kV이며, 배전선 1조당 저항은\n\n 10Ω, 5Ω이다.)\n\n\n① 1195         ② 1200\n\n③ 1205         ④ 1210\n\n⑤ 1215","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m12","number":12},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m12-q.webp","width":696,"height":557},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m12-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1413}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q13","number":13,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 13번","searchText":" 13\n\n피뢰기 제한전압이 725kV, 기준충격 절연강도가 1028\n\nkV일 때, 피뢰기의 보호 여유도는?\n\n\n① 42          ② 47\n\n③ 52          ④ 57\n\n⑤ 62","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m13","number":13},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m13-q.webp","width":678,"height":523},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m13-e1.webp","width":678,"height":469}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 14번","searchText":" 14\n\n코로나 임계전압에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n(단,               이다.)    log\n\n\n\n① 는 상대공기밀도이며,       이다.\n② 는 전선표면계수이다\n\n③ 은 날씨계수이며 1.0이면 맑은날, 0.8이면 흐린날이다.\n④ 코로나 임계전압 의 단위는 V이다.\n\n⑤ 기압이 낮을수록 온도가 높을수록 임계전압은 감소한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m14","number":14},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m14-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m14-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 15번","searchText":" 15\n\n차단기와 관련한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① GIS는 화재의 위험이 없다.\n\n② GCB는 공기절연보다 절연내력이 2~3배, 소호능력이\n\n  200~300배이다.\n\n③ VCB는 폭발음이 없다.\n\n④ OCB는 부싱변류기의 설치가 불가능하다.\n\n⑤ MBB는 회로의 고유주파수의 영향을 받지 않는다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m15","number":15},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m15-q.webp","width":678,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m15-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m15-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1195}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 16번","searchText":" 16\n\n단락전류 10000A , 전류시간 0.5초, 접지선(동손) 허용\n온도 800°C일 때, 보호도체의 단면적mm은?\n\n\n① 25          ② 35\n\n③ 50          ④ 75\n\n⑤ 95","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m16","number":16},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m16-q.webp","width":696,"height":527},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m16-e1.webp","width":696,"height":689},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m16-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 17번","searchText":" 17\n\n154kV계통에서, 80,000kVA , 이다.\n\n100,000kVA에서의 Ω는?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 12.5\n\n③ 15.4         ④ 23.7\n\n⑤ 29.6","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m17","number":17},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m17-q.webp","width":696,"height":563},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m17-e1.webp","width":696,"height":871}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n아래의 조건과 같은 두 대의 변압기를 병렬운전하여 10\n\nkVA, 역률 1인 부하에 전력을 공급할 때, 각 변압기의\n\n전류분담, 는\n\n ⦁변압기  : V, kVA \n            Ω(1차 등가환산 임피던스)\n\n ⦁변압기  : V, kVA \n\n            Ω(1차 등가환산 임피던스)\n\n\n                                   \n ①               \n ②               \n ③                \n ④               \n ⑤              ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":793},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1011},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m18-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1883}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n75kW의 3상 유도전동기를 설치하려고 한다. 이 전동기\n\n는 역률 90로 운전되며, 전원은 3상 3선식, 380V\nAC로 공급된다. 전원에서 전동기까지의 거리는 200m이\n\n며, 도체는 동선이고, 허용되는 전압강하는 6V이하이다.\n전선의 굵기mm는?\n\n\n① 70          ② 95\n\n③ 120         ④ 150\n\n⑤ 185","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":607},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m19-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1149}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n딥 슬롯 농형 전동기 특징으로 옳은 것은?\n\n ㉠ 일반적인 유도전동기보파 슬롯 폭이 좁고 깊이가 깊다.\n\n ㉡ 2중 농형 전동기에 비해 기동 토크가 일반적으로 더\n\n  크고 운전효율도 더 높다.\n\n ㉢ 2중 농형기보다 냉각효과가 우수하다.\n\n ㉣ 2중 농형기보다 최대토크가 작다.\n\n ㉤ 기동시의 전류는 도체 외측으로 흐르고, 운전시의\n\n  전류는 도체 전반적으로 흐른다.\n\n\n① ㉠㉣㉤        ② ㉡㉢㉣\n\n③ ㉢㉣㉤        ④ ㉡㉢㉤\n\n⑤ ㉠㉢㉣㉤","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":739},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m20-e1.webp","width":696,"height":733},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m20-e2.webp","width":678,"height":521}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n과복권 발전기가 무부하에서는 600rpm, 단자전압 112\n\nV, 전부하에서는 580rpm, 116V이다. 전기자 철심\n\n내 자속은 전부하상태가 무부하상태보다 15 높다.\n\n전부하시 전기자, 계자에서 나타나는 의한 총 전압강하V\n\n는?\n\n\n① 6.5          ② 7.0\n\n③ 7.5          ④ 8.0\n\n⑤ 8.5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":537},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m21-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1363}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\nSCR의 특징으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 순방향으로 부성저항 특성을 갖는다.\n\n② 이온 소멸시간이 길다.\n\n③ 순방향 전압강하가 1.5V정도로 낮다.\n\n④ 과전압에 약하다.\n\n⑤ 아크가 생기지 않으므로 열의 발생이 적다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m22-e1.webp","width":696,"height":964}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n단상 반파 정류회로에서 평균 직류전압 200V를 얻는데\n\n필요한 변압기의 2차 상전압V은?\n\n(단, 부하는 순저항이고, 정류기의 전압강하는 10V이다.)\n\n\n① 436         ② 446\n\n③ 456         ④ 466\n\n⑤ 476","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m23-e1.webp","width":696,"height":918}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n정격200kVA , 철손 1kW, 동손 4kW인 단상변압기\n\n의 최대 효율과, 최대 효율시의 부하kVA 는?\n\n\n\n    최대 효율   최대 효율시의 부하kVA\n\n ①        98                 100\n\n ②        98                 200\n\n ③        96                 200\n\n ④        96                 100\n\n ⑤        95                 100","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m24-q.webp","width":696,"height":637},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m24-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P092-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\n다음 중 역률개선의 효과로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 선로, 변압기 등의 저항손은 역률의 제곱에 반비례하여\n\n  감소한다.\n\n② 변압기, 개폐기 등의 소요용량은 역률에 반비례하여 감\n\n  소한다.\n\n③ 설비용량의 여유가 증가한다.\n\n④ 전기요금이 감소한다.\n\n          \n⑤ 전압강하는      에 반비례하여 감소한다.    tan","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국도로공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2025p2-e13-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":795},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e13-m25-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
